\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Two workers killed by tire blowout on Delta plane in Atlanta\b0\par\par\uc2 Richard Luscombe \par \uc2 462 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 August 2024\par 18:51 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A \uc2 Boeing\uc2  757 was undergoing maintenance when a tire blew out, killing two airline workers and injuring another\par \par \uc2 A tire blowout on a \uc2 Delta Air Lines\uc2  jet during maintenance at the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/atlanta"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Atlanta}}}\uc2  airport on Tuesday killed two employees and seriously injured a third, authorities in Georgia said.\par \par \uc2 The two deaths occurred early in the morning in a hangar at the Hartsfield-Jackson international airport as the workers changed the tire, Delta said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Atlanta police department\uc2  Maj Kelley Collier told reporters that emergency crews responded to a call about a tire explosion at the airport\u8217\'20\'19s technical operations maintenance facility at about 5am.\par \par \uc2 The identities of the dead workers were not immediately disclosed. The third Delta employee was taken to hospital with \u8220\'20\'1Cmajor injuries\u8221\'20\'1D, but the worker\u8217\'20\'19s condition on Tuesday afternoon was not known.\par \par \uc2 According to flight records, the three were working on a \uc2 Boeing\uc2  757 jet that arrived from Las Vegas on Sunday night.\par \par \uc2 Delta was cooperating with local authorities and \u8220\'20\'1Cconducting a full investigation to determine what happened\u8221\'20\'1D, the company said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Delta family is heartbroken at the loss of two team members and the injury of another following an incident this morning. We have extended our full support to family members and colleagues during this incredibly difficult time,\u8221\'20\'1D it said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Delta family is grateful for the quick action of first responders and medical teams on site.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The mayor of Atlanta, \uc2 Andre Dickens\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/andreforatlanta/status/1828435315867967937"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted his sympathy}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CI offer my deepest condolences to the family and loved ones of the deceased Delta employees,\u8221\'20\'1D he wrote. \u8220\'20\'1CMy thoughts are also with those who were injured, and I hope for their swift and full recovery.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 International Association of Machinists and Aerospace Workers (IAM)\uc2 , a union that says it represents more than 100,000 airline workers across the US, said the group\u8217\'20\'19s members also wanted a full inquiry into Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s deaths.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIAM stands in solidarity with the community of Atlanta and expresses our deepest condolences to the victims\u8217\'20\'19 families following the tragic incident that occurred this morning,\u8221\'20\'1D it said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.goiam.org/news/imail/iam-union-statement-on-reports-of-deadly-tire-explosion-at-atlanta-delta-air-lines-facility/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in a statement}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs a union dedicated to the well-being and safety of our members and the broader community, we will offer our resources to all those impacted by this tragic event.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe stand in unity with Delta workers during this difficult time and we call on Delta and the relevant authorities to quickly launch a thorough investigation into how this happened.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A spokesperson for the \uc2 Federal Aviation Administration\uc2  said it was aware of the Delta workers\u8217\'20\'19 deaths and was in contact with the airline. Flights in and out of the Hartsfield-Jackson airport were unaffected, airport officials said.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240827ek8r002mi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
