\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 UAW\uc2  files charge against \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  over strike threat\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 410 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 August 2024\par 19:49 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The former president and the billionaire talked about union busting during their online talk on MondayUS politics \u8211\'20\'13 live updates\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/31/united-auto-workers-union-endorses-kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 United Auto Workers}}}\uc2  president, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/04/trump-united-auto-workers-union-shawn-fain-kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shawn Fain}}}\uc2 , called {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  a \u8220\'20\'1Cscab\u8221\'20\'1D on Tuesday as the union {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://uaw-newsroom.prgloo.com/press-release/uaw-files-federal-labor-charges-against-donald-trump-and-elon-musk-for-attempting-to-intimidate-and-threaten-workers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed}}}\uc2  federal unfair labor practice charges against the former president and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk}}}\uc2  on Tuesday over comments the two made during a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/12/trump-elon-musk-interview-key-takeaways"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 live stream on X}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou\u8217\'20\'19re the greatest cutter,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump told Musk. \u8220\'20\'1CI mean, I look at what you do,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/UAW/status/1823343962012123254"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump said}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CYou walk in, you say, You want to quit? They go on strike, I won\u8217\'20\'19t mention the name of the company, but they go on strike and you say, That\u8217\'20\'19s OK, you\u8217\'20\'19re all gone. You\u8217\'20\'19re all gone. So, every one of you is gone.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The union noted that threatening to fire workers for striking is illegal, given all workers have protected rights to strike under federal labor laws in the US.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen we say \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is a scab, this is what we mean. When we say Trump stands against everything our union stands for, this is what we mean,\u8221\'20\'1D said Fain in a press release announcing the charges.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  will always side against workers standing up for themselves, and he will always side with billionaires like \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D said Fain. \u8220\'20\'1CBoth Trump and Musk want working-class people to sit down and shut up, and they laugh about it openly. It\u8217\'20\'19s disgusting, illegal and totally predictable from these two clowns.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Musk has previously been reprimanded for comments made on X, formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 . In 2021, the \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  (\uc2 NLRB\uc2 ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/legal/government/tesla-appeal-over-musk-tweet-unions-tests-nlrb-authority-over-social-media-2024-01-25/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ordered}}}\uc2  Musk to delete a tweet in which he threatened workers for trying to organize a union, ruling the tweet violated federal labor law. Musk is still {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/legal/government/tesla-appeal-over-musk-tweet-unions-tests-nlrb-authority-over-social-media-2024-01-25/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 appealing }}}\uc2  the ruling, while in separate cases he has presented {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/jan/26/anti-union-lawsuit-conservative-courts-musk-starbucks-trader-joes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 arguments}}}\uc2  against labor law violations that claim the \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  is unconstitutional.\par \par \uc2 Trump has a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/23/labor-unions-kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long record}}}\uc2  of opposing labor unions and scaling back worker rights under his first presidential term.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s trying to expose more than anything politically what \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is about in terms of workers, and Musk as well,\u8221\'20\'1D Wilma Liebman, former \uc2 NLRB\uc2  chair under \uc2 Barack Obama\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/us/uaw-files-labor-charges-against-trump-musk-2024-08-13/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Reuters. \u8220\'20\'1CEveryone knows the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  remedies are toothless to start with, but it\u8217\'20\'19s not so much for the remedy as for sending both a political message and an organizing message.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240813ek8d002ut\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
