\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Pakistani man with alleged ties to Iran charged in foiled plot to kill US leaders\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian staff and agencies \par \uc2 463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 August 2024\par 10:38 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Asif Merchant, 46, tried to recruit people for scheme to assassinate figures including \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , says \uc2 FBI\par \par \uc2 A Pakistani man with alleged ties to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/iran"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Iran}}}\uc2  has been charged over a foiled conspiracy to carry out political assassinations on US soil, the justice department said on Tuesday as it disclosed what officials say is the latest murder-for-hire plot to target US public figures.\par \par \uc2 Asif Merchant, 46, sought to recruit people in the United States to carry out the plot in retaliation for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2020/jan/03/baghdad-airport-iraq-attack-deaths-iran-us-tensions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the US killing of Iran\u8217\'20\'19s Revolutionary Guards\u8217\'20\'19 top commander, Qassem Soleimani, in 2020}}}\uc2 , according to a criminal complaint.\par \par \uc2 Merchant, who prosecutors allege spent time in Iran before traveling to the US from Pakistan, was charged with murder for hire in federal court in New York\u8217\'20\'19s Brooklyn borough. A federal judge ordered him detained on 17 July, according to court records.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFor years, the justice department has been working aggressively to counter Iran\u8217\'20\'19s brazen and unrelenting efforts to retaliate against American public officials for the killing of Iranian General Soleimani,\u8221\'20\'1D attorney general \uc2 Merrick Garland\uc2  said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 FBI\uc2  investigators believe that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , who approved the drone strike on Soleimani, and other current and former \uc2 US government\uc2  officials were the intended targets of the plot, CNN reported, citing a US official.\par \par \uc2 Court documents do not name the alleged targets of the plot. Merchant told a law enforcement informant that there would be \u8220\'20\'1Csecurity all around\u8221\'20\'1D one target, according to the criminal complaint.\par \par \uc2 A justice department spokesperson declined to comment further. Avraham Moskowitz, a lawyer for Merchant, did not immediately respond to a request for comment.\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s presidential campaign could not immediately be reached for comment.\par \par \uc2 Trump, the Republican candidate in the 5 November presidential election, was wounded in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donald-trump-pennsylvania-rally-shooting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an assassination attempt}}}\uc2  at a campaign rally in Pennsylvania last month. Garland said on Tuesday that investigators have found no evidence that Merchant had any connection to the shooting, which officials have said was carried out by a lone 20-year-old gunman.\par \par \uc2 Law enforcement officials thwarted Merchant\u8217\'20\'19s plan before any attack was carried out. An individual Merchant contacted in April to help assist with the plot reported his activities to law enforcement and became a confidential informant, according to the complaint.\par \par \uc2 Merchant told the informant his plans also included stealing documents from one target and organizing protests in the US, prosecutors allege.\par \par \uc2 After the failed assassination attempt in Pennsylvania, US officials said that a threat from Iran had prompted the \uc2 US Secret Service\uc2  to boost protection around Trump.\par \par \uc2 At the time, Iran\u8217\'20\'19s mission to the United Nations dismissed the allegations as \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/16/iran-assassination-plot-trump-shooting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unsubstantiated and malicious}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240807ek87001e1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
