\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Liz Cheney\uc2 : controversial NBC hire \uc2 Ronna McDaniel\uc2  enabled Trump \u8216\'20\'18depravity\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 897 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 March 2024\par 22:28 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 McDaniel \u8216\'20\'18facilitated Trump\u8217\'20\'19s corrupt fake elector plot\u8217\'20\'19, says ex-congresswoman as NBC hosts and union group protest\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Republican National Committee\uc2  chair turned NBC politics analyst \uc2 Ronna McDaniel\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cenabled criminality and depravity\u8221\'20\'1D in her support for \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s attempt to overturn the 2020 election, the former congresswoman \uc2 Liz Cheney{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Liz_Cheney/status/1771916401726705757?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  as controversy swirled over McDaniel\u8217\'20\'19s media role.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRonna facilitated Trump\u8217\'20\'19s corrupt fake elector plot and his effort to pressure Michigan officials not to certify the legitimate election outcome,\u8221\'20\'1D Cheney, a Republican who was vice-chair of the House January 6 committee, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Liz_Cheney/status/1771916401726705757?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  on social media.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShe spread his lies and called January 6 \u8216\'20\'18legitimate political discourse\u8217\'20\'19. That\u8217\'20\'19s not \u8216\'20\'18taking one for the team\u8217\'20\'19. It\u8217\'20\'19s enabling criminality and depravity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 McDaniel rose in Republican politics as a member of the powerful Romney family before reportedly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/homenews/administration/364060-trump-asked-rnc-chairwoman-to-stop-using-romney-in-her-name-report/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropping}}}\uc2  the name at Trump\u8217\'20\'19s behest and becoming \uc2 RNC\uc2  chair in 2017.\par \par \uc2 In February 2022, the \uc2 RNC{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/jdawsey1/status/1489434467617755138"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  Cheney and \uc2 Adam Kinzinger\uc2 , the other anti-Trump Republican on the committee that investigated the deadly attack on Congress on 6 January 2021, were engaged in the \u8220\'20\'1Cpersecution of ordinary citizens engaged in legitimate political discourse\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Cheney lost her seat in Congress that year. Kinzinger chose to retire. McDaniel was eased out of the \uc2 RNC\uc2  last month, to be replaced in part by \uc2 Lara Trump\uc2 , the former president\u8217\'20\'19s daughter-in-law.\par \par \uc2 McDaniel\u8217\'20\'19s NBC role was announced last week. On Sunday, she appeared on Meet the Press, the flagship politics show.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/25/republican-national-committee-chair-ronna-mcdaniel-biden-2020-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Characterising}}}\uc2  her support for Trump\u8217\'20\'19s election fraud lies as \u8220\'20\'1Ctaking one for the whole team\u8221\'20\'1D, she said she did \u8220\'20\'1Cnot think violence should be in our political discourse\u8221\'20\'1D and that Biden won \u8220\'20\'1Cfair and square\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 but still claimed it was \u8220\'20\'1Cfair to say there were problems [with battleground state elections] in 2020\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 A former Meet the Press host, Chuck Todd, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/03/24/business/chuck-todd-rips-nbc-news-ronna-mcdaniel/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issued}}}\uc2  an on-air protest.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere\u8217\'20\'19s a reason why there\u8217\'20\'19s a lot of journalists at NBC News uncomfortable with this,\u8221\'20\'1D he told the current host, Kristin Welker, \u8220\'20\'1Cbecause many of our professional dealings with the \uc2 RNC\uc2  over the last six years have been met with gaslighting, have been met with character assassination.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Monday brought proliferating {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theatlantic.com/ideas/archive/2024/03/what-purpose-does-nbc-hiring-ronna-mcdaniel-serve/677875/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2  of staff discontent \u8211\'20\'13 and its open expression by two of the network\u8217\'20\'19s biggest names.\par \par \uc2 On Morning Joe, the MSNBC show that often sets the Washington agenda, co-host Joe Scarborough, a former Republican congressman, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mediaite.com/media/morning-joe-hammers-nbc-decision-to-hire-ronna-mcdaniel-with-supercut-of-her-election-denial/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ve been inundated with calls this weekend, as have most people connected with this network, about NBC\u8217\'20\'19s decision to hire\u8221\'20\'1D McDaniel.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe learned about the hiring when we read about it in the press on Friday. We weren\u8217\'20\'19t asked our opinion of the hiring but if we were, we would have strongly objected to it for several reasons including, but not limited to, as lawyers might say, Miss McDaniel\u8217\'20\'19s role in \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s fake elector scheme and her pressuring election officials to not certify election results while \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  was on the phone.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Scarborough\u8217\'20\'19s wife and co-host, \uc2 Mika Brzezinski\uc2 , said: \u8220\'20\'1CTo be clear, we believe NBC news should seek out conservative Republican voices to provide balance in their election coverage.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut it should be conservative Republicans, not a person who used her position of power to be an anti-democracy election denier. And we hope NBC will reconsider its decision. It goes without saying that she will not be a guest on Morning Joe in her capacity as a paid contributor. Here\u8217\'20\'19s why.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 There followed a compilation of McDaniel\u8217\'20\'19s comments about the 2020 election, which Brzezinski called \u8220\'20\'1Cexhausting\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Later, the host, Nicole Wallace \u8211\'20\'13 once White House communications director for \uc2 George W Bush\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/25/business/media/nbc-ronna-mcdaniel-rebellion.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told viewers}}}\uc2  NBC had, by hiring McDaniel, \u8220\'20\'1Cwittingly or unwittingly\u8221\'20\'1D told election deniers they could spread Trump\u8217\'20\'19s lies on \u8220\'20\'1Cour sacred airwaves\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 One of Wallace\u8217\'20\'19s guests, Yale historian Timothy Snyder, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/books/2017/mar/08/on-tyranny-timothy-snyder-review-trump-twenty-lessons-democracy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  of the book On Tyranny, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mediaite.com/media/msnbc-guest-flames-nbc-news-for-hiring-ronna-mcdaniel-this-is-pretty-bad/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CWhat NBC has done of its own volition is bring into a very important conversation about democracy, one which is going to take place for the next seven months or so, someone who \u8230\'20\'26 tried to disassemble our democracy. Who personally took part in an attempt to undo the American system.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 NBC, Snyder said, was making an \u8220\'20\'1Cadjustment in advance\u8221\'20\'1D of a possible Trump victory: \u8220\'20\'1CSo yeah, I think this is pretty bad.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As observers waited to see what primetime stars including \uc2 Jen Psaki\uc2  and Rachel Madow might say on Monday night, disquiet was also reported over McDaniel\u8217\'20\'19s reported $300,000 deal.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAcross MSNBC they have been cutting contributors,\u8221\'20\'1D an unnamed host {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/playbook"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Politico}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CSo everyone\u8217\'20\'19s like, what the fuck? You found 300 for her?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Later on Monday, the union group NBC News Guild, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/nbcnewsguild/status/1772316308631154734"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  on social media: \u8220\'20\'1CTwo weeks before NBC News proudly announced the hiring of \uc2 Ronna McDaniel\uc2 , execs illegally terminated 13 union journalists.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 No explanation was offered for the layoffs, the Guild said, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CActions speak clearly \u8211\'20\'13 NBC prioritised an election denier over its own reporters.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRonna encouraged a lie that many of our own journalists have spent countless hours debunking. Our journalism is tarnished by \u8230\'20\'26 executives elevating a liar over the workers who have spent years delivering the kind of reporting that our newsrooms are typically known for.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 NBC did not comment, nor did McDaniel.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240325ek3p0030l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
